msgid "Network: %s"
msgstr ""

msgid "The cabinets link in a ring over the network (Wi-Fi or cable): each listens on its port and connects to the next one; with two, each has the other as next. All the computers can take the same port, for example 15112, and Next cabinet = the other computer's address:15112. In test mode (F2) > GAME SYSTEM, set LINK ID (one MASTER, the others SLAVE) and a different CAR NUMBER on each. The 1994 game (revision A) supports link play."
